Once upon a time, the Sun shone brightly over the earth. Every morning, it painted the sky with oranges and pinks. 

The Sun warmed the oceans and helped flowers bloom. Animals awoke to its gentle light, feeling safe and happy.

One day, the Sun noticed the moon shining at night. They admired each other's beauty from afar. 

The Sun decided to gift the moon a shimmering glow, so it would never feel alone. From then on, they danced together in the sky, day and night. 

The Earth thrived under their watchful eyes, united by their friendship. And thus, they became the perfect pair, lighting up the world forever.
